{
	"name": "LiveConnect 01 — Configure the Proxy Webhook",
	"nodes": [
		{
			"parameters": {
				"content": "## Step 0 — Configure the channel webhook\n\nRegister your chatbot's URL (workflows 03/04) as the channel webhook in LiveConnect.\n\n1. Run the workflow: it lists the account's channels.\n2. In **Set Webhook** replace:\n   - `id_canal`: the ID of the channel you want to connect (comes from the previous node)\n   - `url`: the **Production** URL of your chatbot's Webhook (e.g. `https://your-n8n.com/webhook/liveconnect-chatbot`)\n   - `secret`: your own secret (LiveConnect forwards it so you can validate the calls)\n\nTo disable the webhook: `estado = 0`.",
				"height": 320,
				"width": 420
			},
			"id": "b1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
			"name": "Instructions",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
			"typeVersion": 1,
			"position": [0, -100]
		},
		{
			"parameters": {},
			"id": "b1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
			"name": "Run Manually",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
			"typeVersion": 1,
			"position": [480, 40]
		},
		{
			"parameters": {
				"resource": "channel",
				"operation": "getMany",
				"filters": {}
			},
			"id": "b1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
			"name": "List Channels",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-liveconnect.liveConnect",
			"typeVersion": 1,
			"position": [700, 40]
		},
		{
			"parameters": {
				"resource": "proxy",
				"operation": "setWebhook",
				"id_canal": "={{ $json.id }}",
				"url": "https://YOUR-N8N.com/webhook/liveconnect-chatbot",
				"estado": 1,
				"secret": "change-this-secret"
			},
			"id": "b1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
			"name": "Set Webhook",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-liveconnect.liveConnect",
			"typeVersion": 1,
			"position": [920, 40]
		}
	],
	"connections": {
